---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = { title: 'Web3 & 区块链 / Web3 & Blockchain' };
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Web3 & 区块链 / Web3 & Blockchain</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-8">
      从 DeFi 到 NFT，从钱包到智能合约——帮你看懂链上世界，找到 Web3 出海的正确姿势。
      <br />
      From DeFi to NFTs, wallets to smart contracts — understand the on-chain world and find the right way to go global with Web3.
    </p>
    <a href="/" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">← 返回首页 / Back to Home</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
